{"id":"858d5de23691d48d","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-true-stage-function.md","title":"Δ₂ 近似的真阶段计算函数","display":"df-true-stage-function — Δ₂ 近似的真阶段计算函数","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-true-stage-function","aliases":["20-df-true-stage-function"],"display":"df-true-stage-function — Δ₂ 近似的真阶段计算函数","chapter":"5","section":"5.6.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 5.6.5","source_printed_pages":[126],"source_pdf_pages":[161],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-approximation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-true-stage-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-true-stage-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-true-stage-function — Δ₂ 近似的真阶段计算函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"5"},{"key":"section","html":"5.6.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 5.6.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>126</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>161</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\omega^2\\to2\">\\(a:\\omega^2\\to2\\)</span> 全可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\">\\(a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A\\)</span>；前缀使用半开区间。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true-stage-function}\\vdash\nc_{a,A}(x):=\\mu s&gt;x\\ \\forall y\\le x\\ [a(y,s)=\\chi_A(y)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true-stage-function}\\vdash\nc_{a,A}(x):=\\mu s&gt;x\\ \\forall y\\le x\\ [a(y,s)=\\chi_A(y)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个有限前缀最终稳定，故该最小数存在。它只要求该次前缀正确，后来仍可能反复；稳定模要求从某时刻起永远正确，两者不同。使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\le x\">\\(y\\le x\\)</span> 对应本目录长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x+1\">\\(x+1\\)</span> 的前缀。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 5.6.5；印刷页 126；PDF 第 161 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-approximation]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"a:\\omega^2\\to2","display":false},{"tex":"a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}true-stage-function}\\vdash\nc_{a,A}(x):=\\mu s>x\\ \\forall y\\le x\\ [a(y,s)=\\chi_A(y)].","display":true},{"tex":"y\\le x","display":false},{"tex":"x+1","display":false}],"bytes":1182,"backlinks":[{"id":"5c18af15d55babd2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-true-stage-function]]；see [[20-df-domination]]。"},{"id":"4e7ca846b90080b6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-true-stage-function]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"}],"outgoing":["ea4f6c0d21b23194"]}